            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[NUPHY-RELEASE-NOTES 1
version:1.2.39
[zh-CN]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.39

• 修正 Codex 命令键读取界面控件的路径，保留普通/极速、批准、拒绝、新聊天、听写和发送的默认分配。
• 重新检查首次授权，系统已允许但旧进程未生效时，安全恢复键盘后自动重新打开 NuPhy Lab 一次。
• 保留 Air75 V3 连接动画；此版本用于验证首次授权和实体按键。
[en]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.39

• Correct Codex control traversal while preserving the default command key assignments.
• Check newly granted permissions in a fresh process and safely reopen NuPhy Lab once if the old process has stale authorization.
• Preserve the Air75 V3 connection animation. This build is for permission and physical-key testing.
]]></description>
